  "description": "It's a dark, quiet night in a forest of buildings, to an empty office where the people who do the work have already left for the day.\n\nWho would have thought. A quiet, hard-working employee from Yeonju would walk into the office this late at night in a skirt and no underwear.\n\n\"Why are you so wet?\"\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Naver](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=4708070)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/landing/episode/9034), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1515031095), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000059414), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10249194), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/10080), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230821), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/taste_of_boss), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/uplmscg/episode/toon/7505), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H045098852), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H045098852), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63500287)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR19: [T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/romance/taste-of-boss/list?title_no=6144), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/175506)     \nR15: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/175505)",
